1
00:00:00,260 --> 00:00:02,700
Donald is in the second grade.

2
00:00:03,340 --> 00:00:05,940
His reading level is not as good as

3
00:00:05,940 --> 00:00:07,119
the other students.

4
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:10,480
He wants to improve his English skills.

5
00:00:11,220 --> 00:00:12,760
He starts to read more.

6
00:00:13,620 --> 00:00:16,080
He looks up words he does not know

7
00:00:16,080 --> 00:00:16,980
in the dictionary.

8
00:00:18,180 --> 00:00:20,660
He writes down what the words mean.

9
00:00:21,780 --> 00:00:24,500
Afterwards, he reads the book again.
